---
import PageIntro from '../components/PageIntro.astro';
import { SITE } from '../config';
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="About After the Diagram, Ve Sharma's publication on AI developer platforms, cloud economics, and software delivery."
>
  <div class="wide-shell">
    <PageIntro
      eyebrow="About After the Diagram"
      title="Technical strategy is only the beginning."
      description="I write about what follows: platform choices, cloud economics, and the operating decisions that turn architecture into software people can use."
    />

    <div class="about-grid">
      <article class="prose">
        <h2>What this publication is</h2>
        <p>
          After the Diagram is my independent publication about AI developer
          platforms, cloud economics, and agentic software delivery. I examine
          how architecture, tooling, team design, governance, and adoption shape
          what actually ships.
        </p>

        <p>
          Posts are concise field notes: a pattern, tradeoff, implementation
          detail, or lesson from practice. White papers give the evidence and
          systems questions more room. Both formats share one goal: make the
          reasoning visible.
        </p>

        <h2>Why this perspective</h2>
        <p>
          My background spans cloud architecture, full-stack product
          development, applied AI, and engineering leadership. I co-founded and
          built a B2B SaaS platform that reached millions of listeners. I have
          also led engineering teams, advised founders on cloud and AI
          implementation, and helped organizations adopt developer tools.
        </p>

        <p>
          I use that range to connect technical choices with their operating
          context: cost, team capacity, governance, developer experience, and
          the path from a promising prototype to durable software. The goal is
          not a universal playbook. It is to make the reasoning visible.
        </p>
      </article>

      <aside class="about-aside">
        <dl>
          <div>
            <dt>Author</dt>
            <dd>
              <a class="text-link" href={SITE.authorUrl} rel="author">
                {SITE.author}
              </a>
            </dd>
          </div>
          <div>
            <dt>Role</dt>
            <dd>{SITE.authorRole}</dd>
          </div>
          <div>
            <dt>Focus</dt>
            <dd>AI developer platforms, cloud economics, software delivery</dd>
          </div>
          <div>
            <dt>Formats</dt>
            <dd>Posts and numbered white papers</dd>
          </div>
          <div>
            <dt>Source</dt>
            <dd><a class="text-link" href={SITE.githubUrl}>GitHub</a></dd>
          </div>
        </dl>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
